 * Validate that duplicate notification subscription creation fails as expected.
 *
 * This test confirms that when a member attempts to subscribe to the same notification target more than once, the API enforces a uniqueness constraint and blocks the duplicate. This ensures proper adherence to the business rule that a member cannot have multiple subscriptions to the same resource, preventing redundant notifications and inconsistent subscription state.
