 * 2. Create a new thread (POST /discussionBoard/articles/threads) as the member, with a unique category (UUID), title and body, plus is_pinned/is_closed. Confirm the thread is created and fields match expectation.
 * 3. Create a new post (POST /discussionBoard/articles/posts) in that thread, as the member, with content. Validate returned post object.
 * 4. Create a file attachment (POST /discussionBoard/articles/attachments) connected to the post, uploaded by the member. Supply post UUID, member UUID, file_name, file_uri (valid URL), content_type (valid MIME), and unique content_hash. Validate the returned attachment object:
 *    - All properties (IDs, file meta, uploader, created_at) are present and correctly reflect the input.
 *    - post_id and member_id match the created post/member
 *    - No fields missing as per IDiscussionBoardAttachment schema
 */
