 * 4. Upload (create) an attachment and associate it to the created post, specifying the uploader as the new member.
 * 5. Perform the first soft delete (DELETE) for the newly uploaded attachment and check succeeded deletion.
 * 6. Attempt to delete the same attachment again: expect an error to be thrown (404 or already deleted error).
 */
